# Privacy Policy

Last updated: Juli 2026

We take the protection of your data very seriously. 
This app is designed to manage your game collection locally on your device.

## 1. Data Collection
This app stores all data (game collection, profile name, avatar path) exclusively locally
on your device using 'Shared Preferences'. No data is transmitted to external servers.

## 2. Permissions
The app requires access to your storage/gallery to select game covers or a profile picture. 
These images are also stored locally on the device only.

## 3. Third Parties
No data is shared with third parties, sold, or used for advertising purposes.

## 4. Contact
If you have any questions regarding data protection, 
you can contact the developer directly.
